<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Results and Analyses ‣ Mitigating Strategy Preference Bias in Emotional Support Conversation via Uncertainty Estimations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Analysis</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS4.SSS1" title="In 5.4 Analysis ‣ 5 Results and Analyses ‣ Mitigating Strategy Preference Bias in Emotional Support Conversation via Uncertainty Estimations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4.1 </span>Effect of Weakly Known Samples</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS4.SSS2" title="In 5.4 Analysis ‣ 5 Results and Analyses ‣ Mitigating Strategy Preference Bias in Emotional Support Conversation via Uncertainty Estimations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4.2 </span>Effect of Sampling Number</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
